<title>UK: BAe to pay 90 mln stg for STN Atlas stake.</title>
<headline>BAe to pay 90 mln stg for STN Atlas stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Aerospace Plc said on Wednesday it would pay around 90 million stg for a 49 percent stake in German electronics company STN Atlas.</p>
<p>German defence group Rheinmetall Berlin AG and utility Badenwerk AG said last December they would buy 51 percent of STN Atlas and BAe would buy the remainder.</p>
</text>
